<title>USA: Midland, Texas, won by NationsBanc.</title>
<headline>Midland, Texas, won by NationsBanc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBanc Capital Markets, Inc. said it won $4.750 million of Midland, Texas tax and waterworks and sewer system limited tax revenue certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.85 percent.</p>
</text>
